settings.scope.text = Server-side search and category pagination, async details, lazy Jellyfin poster loading with a bounded texture cache, and a server-transcode MPV playback proof are included. Resume, reports, and track controls are wired; live-server/platform validation, offline download wiring, Live TV, and credential persistence remain open.
